////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
// 2. CORE AXIOMS
////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

AXIOM_1: â€œParasite of perceptionâ€ = internalized conceptual program that feeds on divisive thinking and self-identity.
AXIOM_2: All suffering is entangled with misperception of separation and the worship of reflected images (Shadow, Ego, Idols).
AXIOM_3: Path of least resistance (in this context) = total self-annihilation of false self, not hedonistic ease.
